# PartyPrivateWizardHereticDD2Curse (22165, a private of a master), every draw 0, holding an attack desire on the
# character: its master's call for help (10033) on the character drops its attack desires, sets its engaged flag
# (int slot 4) and enters the character in its hate list by 200; its master's call to walk home (10035) clears the
# flag and wants it home (100); its master's shouted target (10002) adds 200 more to the hate list. A call naming
# another sender, or no creature, changes nothing.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.WizardBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyPrivateWizard.PartyPrivateWizard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyPrivateWizard.PartyPrivateWizardDD2
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyPrivateWizard.PartyPrivateWizardDD2Curse
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyPrivateWizard.PartyPrivateWizardHereticDD2Curse
npc master 20003 Monster 300 0 0
npc priv 22165 Monster 200 0 0 walks master master

want priv player 500
  desires priv attack(player)=500
event priv 10033 character master
  mem priv i_ai4=1
  desires priv -
jump priv 100 0 0
event priv 10035 0 master
  mem priv i_ai4=0
  desires priv move_to(200,0,0)=100
event priv 10002 character master
  mem priv i_ai4=0
event priv 10033 character character
  mem priv i_ai4=0
event priv 10033 0 master
  mem priv i_ai4=0
